TITLE 1D transport with cation exchange

SOLUTION 0-9
    pH 7.0 charge
    Ca 1.0
    Cl 2.0

SOLUTION 10
    pH 7.0 charge
    Na 1.0
    Cl 1.0

EXCHANGE 0-9
    X 0.001

SAVE solution 0-9
SAVE exchange 0-9

TRANSPORT
    -cells 10
    -shifts 10
    -time_step 1
    -lengths 1
    -dispersivities 0
    -boundary_conditions flux flux
    -print_cells 1-10
    -print_frequency 1
    -punch_cells 4
    -punch_frequency 1
    -initial_time 0
    -flow_direction forward

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file transport_sel.out
    -reset false
    -simulation true
    -state true
    -totals Na Ca Cl
    -molalities NaX CaX2 X-
